WEBVTT

00:12:27.976 --> 00:12:31.253
It is, in fact, this that could become the framework

00:12:31.253 --> 00:12:34.274
for producing new social

00:12:34.274 --> 00:12:37.330
and economic justice in the city.

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:38.948
I want to say this and emphasize it,

00:12:38.948 --> 00:12:42.597
because this is the only way I see

00:12:42.597 --> 00:12:44.810
that can enable us to move

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:48.035
from urbanizations of consumption

00:12:48.035 --> 00:12:51.393
to neighborhoods of production today.

00:12:51.393 --> 00:12:53.281
Thank you.

00:12:53.281 --> 00:12:57.281
(Applause)